@CONTROL_PLANE_API_KEY = clave-de-control-plane

### Listar pagos (sin filtros)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/admin/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{CONTROL_PLANE_API_KEY}}

### Listar pagos con paginación
GET http://localhost:3000/api/admin/payments?page=1&limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{CONTROL_PLANE_API_KEY}}

### Filtrar por estado (valores válidos: pending, approved, rejected, cancelled, expired)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/admin/payments?status=pending
Authorization: Bearer {{CONTROL_PLANE_API_KEY}}

### Buscar por nombre o orderId
GET http://localhost:3000/api/admin/payments?q=Enrique
Authorization: Bearer {{CONTROL_PLANE_API_KEY}}

### Combinado: búsqueda + estado + paginación
GET http://localhost:3000/api/admin/payments?q=Agua&status=approved&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{CONTROL_PLANE_API_KEY}}

### Obtener un pago por ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/admin/payments/cmqt38dxv0000kz04i7frpduy
Authorization: Bearer {{CONTROL_PLANE_API_KEY}}

### Cancelar pago pendiente (pending → cancelled)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/admin/payments/cmqsifjpg001luwd4o14ems43/status
Authorization: Bearer {{CONTROL_PLANE_API_KEY}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "cancelled" }
